    Nails: 1 UV unit = 1.844 m (p5 1.706, p95 3.073)
    Body: 1 UV unit = 1.687 m (p5 0.805, p95 2.551)
    Cornea: 1 UV unit = 0.450 m (p5 0.264, p95 0.490)
